asset:        packaging/ios/FilmCraft/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/AppIcon.png
title:        FilmCraft iPadOS app icon (owl with ear tufts), 1024 px, no alpha
author:       Brandon Thomas (FilmCraft owner), for the FilmCraft project
source:       original work: assets/app-icon/filmcraft.svg rendered at 1024 px without its rounded-corner clip and flattened onto the full-bleed app colour #8b5cf6
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
license-file: assets/app-icon/LICENSE.txt
added:        2026-10-14 by Claude (agent) for the iPadOS fork
notes:        iOS applies its own corner mask and rejects transparency, so the clip and alpha channel are removed. One image that Xcode scales to every iPad size.
